
>> Size := Kipengee mpya.
Size ikija: ['is:'] fanya: { :nambari
	nambari ikija: ['+'] fanya: { :nambari
		>> unit := nambari kizio.
		>> factor := 1.
		
		unit
		ikiwa: ['inch'] fanya: { factor := 0.0833. }. <- binafsi + (nambari * factor).
	}. <- nambari.
}.

# This size number can be used as follows:

>> plank := Size is: 6 foot.
>> edge := Size is: 50 inch.

# This will show as: 10.165
Towe andika: plank + edge, mstari-mpya.
